    "description": {
      "value": "<div><p>You have a quick hand and keen eye when employing firearms, granting you the following benefits:</p><div><div><ul><li><p>Increase your Strength or Dexterity score by 1, to a maximum of 20.</p></li><li><p>You gain proficiency with all firearms.</p></li><li><p>Being within 5 feet of a hostile creature doesn’t impose disadvantage on your ranged attack rolls.</p></li><li><p>You do not need a free hand to reload a firearm.</p></li></ul></div></div></div>",
